.TH ZERODDS-CORBA-BRIDGED 1 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-corba-bridged \- DDS to CORBA GIOP/IIOP bridge daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-corba-bridged
[\fB\-c\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-validate\-only\fR]
[\fB\-V\fR | \fB\-h\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-corba-bridged
implements the CORBA-Coexistence layer: it terminates IIOP 1.0/1.1/1.2,
multiplexes POA-rooted servants onto DDS topics, persists IORs and
optionally enables CSIv2 mTLS for finance-grade deployments.
Implements
.IR zerodds-corba-bridge-1.0 (7).
.SH OPTIONS
.BR \-c , \-\-log\-level , \-\-validate\-only , \-V , \-h .
.SH SIGNALS
SIGTERM, SIGHUP.
.SH FILES
.IR /etc/zerodds/corba-bridged.yaml ", " /var/lib/zerodds/corba-ior-cache.bin .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-corba-bridged.yaml (5).
.SH STANDARDS
CORBA 3.3, GIOP 1.2, CSIv2.
.SH AUTHORS
ZeroDDS Contributors.
